    "original_requirement": "实现一个智能洗衣流程监控系统，使用振动传感器 D2、水位传感器 A0、蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和按钮 D3。系统根据振动和水位判断洗衣机处于进水、洗涤、甩干和结束四个阶段，并在数码管显示阶段编号；当检测到结束阶段时蜂鸣器鸣叫并闪烁 LED，直到用户按键确认。若长时间无振动且水位异常，则串口输出 wash fault。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个智能洗衣流程监控系统，使用振动传感器 D2、水位传感器 A0、蜂鸣器 D6、LED D13、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和按钮 D3。系统根据振动和水位判断洗衣机处于进水、洗涤、甩干和结束四个阶段，并在数码管显示阶段编号；当检测到结束阶段时蜂鸣器鸣叫并闪烁 LED，直到用户按键确认。若长时间无振动且水位异常，则串口输出 wash fault。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D3\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
